          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Deleting main_w before the cleanup may lead to further issues as callbacks might be fired which in turn may reference MainWindow. MainWindow should definitely be cleaned up at the latest possible point.\n\nI don't think that this is a valid change for #17590",
